From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0024-vdec-frames-without-decoder.patch

Source: 0024-vdec-frames-without-decoder.patch
Build gate: EDEN_MIGRATE_020=1 (default off). Original runtime gates retained.
Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex (offline migration).

diff --git a/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h b/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
index fa49b3b3e307ea75f5066504461c5a300d2bb999..fa7e44b8da69be7c17c3caa7a8cbbe457c970a06 100644
--- a/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
+++ b/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
@@ -2854,6 +2854,12 @@ private:
                 const u64 pts = picture.pts;
                 m_decoded.push_back({std::move(picture), pts, false});
             }
+            // No decoder for this codec (a build without AV1): still give each input a frame,
+            // without a picture, so the images handed out complete in step and the movie ends on
+            // time instead of the client waiting for frames that never come.
+            if (pictures.empty() && !input.end && decoder && !decoder->IsOpen()) {
+                m_decoded.push_back({std::nullopt, input.pts, false});
+            }
             if (input.end) {
                 // The client stops at the frame marked end of stream; give it one even when the
                 // last input held no picture.
